  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Abidjan-Lagos Trade and Transport Facilitation Project (ALTTFP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The  objective of the ALTTFP (APL1) is to reduce trade and transport barriers in the ports and on the roads along the Abidjan-Lagos corridor in Ghana, Togo, and Benin.</narrative>
  </description>
